# Conclusion

The Open Oncology Care Platform adopts a standardised development environment to ensure consistency, reproducibility, and reliability across all contributors. By defining clear hardware, software, networking, and tooling requirements, the project minimises environment-related issues and establishes a solid foundation for deploying OpenSRP and its supporting interoperability services.
